\layout Standard

Real networks are more complex than the simple network we describe here.
 Many cannot be studied analytically and therefore their statistics must
 be determined through simulation.
 Summarize what you have learned from the simple example above about the
 possible dangers of such simulations.
 
\end_deeper 
